    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d693">

                <pb facs="0693" n="623" sameAs="frus:frus1934v04/pg623"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.51/868: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-02-03T11:00:00-03:00">February 3, 1934—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 3:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>25. Department’s 15, February 2, 3 p.m. The Minister of Finance states that the
                    decree embodying debt plan will be signed Monday February 5th, and be published
                    in the local papers the following day.<anchor n="83" xml:id="d693-f1"/> Text of
                    decree will be telegraphed to Brazilian Embassy and may be obtained there.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gibson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d693-f1" n="83" xml:id="d693-f1-content">
                <p>For text of decree No. 23829, February 5, 1934, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Diario Oficial</hi>, February 7, 1934, p. 2689.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
